{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo lets you play unlimited runs of Awrak up to the final floor, with a limited selection of upgrades and zones. The full game adds collections, achievements, and many more features to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Gameplay loop:</u></strong> Build insane combos with your characters and cards to reach massive numbers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753830/extras/Main.gif?t=1747896109\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Key features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Characters:</strong> Choose from a different set of characters, each with its own special way of attacking and upgrading. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deckbuilding:</strong> Start with plain cards and craft them into powerful versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753830/extras/CardCrafting.gif?t=1747896109\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relics:</strong> Choose from over 100 unique relics, each offering distinct abilities and effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753830/extras/Relics.png?t=1747896109\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Empowers:</strong> Transform how your characters play by enhancing their skills and projectiles in powerful new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockables &amp; Achievements:</strong> Unlock new relics, characters, crafting options, monsters and empowers by completing achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><